  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;NOTE A - ORGANIZATION, OPERATIONS AND BASIS OF PRESENTATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuStar Pipeline Operating Partnership L.P. ("&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;") is a Delaware limited liability partnership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; owns 99%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; interest in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Cooperatie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Nustar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Holdings U.A., a Netherlands compan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;y. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; is owned 99% by NuStar Pipeline Partners L.P., and 1% by NuStar Pipeline Company, LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Sunoco Midstream Merger.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Effective July 1,2025, the membership interest in Shore Terminals LLC held by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; was transferred to Sunoco Midstream LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; owns pipeline systems that transport refined petroleum products, including gasoline, diesel, and propane throughout Kansas, Nebraska, Iowa, South Dakota, North Dakota, and Minnesota. In addition, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; operates an anhydrous ammonia pipeline system in Louisiana, Arkansas, Missouri, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Nebraska. Anhydrous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; ammonia is primarily used as agricultural fertilizer and used as a feedstock &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; a few industrial applications.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Regulation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; transportation activities are subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC") and various federal and state authorities. Regulatory bodies exercise statutory authority over matters such as rates, underlying accounting practices, and rate-making agreements with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Basis of Presentation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The financial statements presented herein are prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the FERC, as set forth in the applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which constitute a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America ("GAAP"). The most significant difference between GAAP and the financial statements presented herein are: (1) subsidiaries are reflected on the equity method whereas GAAP requires that all majority-owned subsidiaries be consolidated (2) classification of certain accounts on the balance sheet, statement of income and the statement of cash flows and (3) use of FERC approved depreciation rates.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;NuPop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#x2019;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;FERC Form 6 for the year ended December 31, 2025. The financial statements are unaudited, but in the opinion of management, all adjustments have been made that are necessary to fairly state the financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the periods presented. Certain information and notes that would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 6 have been omitted.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;NOTE B - SUPPLEMENTAL CASH FLOW INFORMATION:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:10pt; margin-bottom:10pt; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Accrued capital expenditures as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;June &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;and 2025 were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;8.2 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;million and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; million, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="HH11476EB422E065C84DE3B12A8533C405" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
